of the matrix \n$C=\\begin{bmatrix}3 & -1 & -1 \\\\ 1 & -3 & 3 \\\\ 1 & 2 & -2\\end{bmatrix}.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we find the matrix $\\,C-\\lambda I:$\n﻿﻿﻿\n\n$$\nC-\\lambda I=\\begin{bmatrix}3-\\lambda  & -1 & -1 \\\\ 1 & -3-\\lambda  & 3 \\\\ 1 & 2 & -2-\\lambda \\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nThe characteristic equation is $det(C-\\lambda I)=0.$ \n\nExpanding the determinant across the $1$st row, we get the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(C-\\lambda I) & =0 \\\\ \\begin{vmatrix}3-\\lambda  & -1 & -1 \\\\ 1 & -3-\\lambda  & 3 \\\\ 1 & 2 & -2-\\lambda \\end{vmatrix} & =0 \\\\ (3-\\lambda )\\begin{vmatrix}-3-\\lambda  & 3 \\\\ 2 & -2-\\lambda \\end{vmatrix}-(-1)\\begin{vmatrix}1 & 3 \\\\ 1 & -2-\\lambda \\end{vmatrix}+(-1)\\begin{vmatrix}1 & -3-\\lambda  \\\\ 1 & 2\\end{vmatrix} & =0 \\\\ (3-\\lambda )({\\lambda }^{2}+5\\lambda )+(-\\lambda -5)-(5+\\lambda ) & =0 \\\\ (-{\\lambda }^{3}-2{\\lambda }^{2}+15\\lambda )-\\lambda -5-5-\\lambda  & =0 \\\\ -{\\lambda }^{3}-2{\\lambda }^{2}+13\\lambda -10 & =0 \\\\ {\\lambda }^{3}+2{\\lambda }^{2}-13\\lambda +10 & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186323910 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4c92bdd9-561f-50f8-a0af-b026acb7e7d2" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\lambda }^{3}-4{\\lambda }^{2}+\\lambda -52=0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186321751} {:answer/id #uuid "679f1b6a-bb22-58ad-9008-20f76acaf14c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\lambda }^{3}-10{\\lambda }^{2}+43\\lambda -90=0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186321955} {:answer/id #uuid "688684d9-f540-59a5-826c-2faac539f6c6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\lambda }^{3}+7{\\lambda }^{2}-5\\lambda -48=0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186321961} {:answer/id #uuid "a6e445b9-3e7b-5df5-8de9-a07b0a91fd34" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\lambda }^{3}-4{\\lambda }^{2}+\\lambda +6=0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186322453} {:answer/id #uuid "c8f0d