idth=\"30px\">\n{{field-4}}\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\"></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>" :question/worked-solution "First, we rewrite the polynomial, interpreting any constants as multiples of the identity matrix:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(X) & ={X}^{2}+1 \\\\  & ={X}^{2}+I\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, we want to find $f(A)={A}^{2}+I.$\n\nLet's calculate ${A}^{2}$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{A}^{2} & =A\\cdot A \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}0 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\\cdot \\begin{bmatrix}0 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -1\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can evaluate $f(A):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(A) & ={A}^{2}+I \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -1\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-1+1 & 0+0 \\\\ 0+0 & -1+1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186295081 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "25a741d8-d805-57c3-8eaa-5ecef1b3a0ed" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186293096}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186293096} :answer-field/id #uuid "632bc6b6-c108-51f2-b004-14e93510b50a" :answer-field/key "field-4" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186294282} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "685532a8-90a1-5df3-93e7-241442d63017" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "18" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186293366}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "18" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186293366} :answer-field/id #uuid "6f1b6f21-ebdd-5a30-b1c8-5acccaf74033" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186294320} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "5496ad78-503c-50d7-a729-8c21a4ed9ac